 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Systematic change",
     "texto": [
      "Indirect object pronouns change their final vowel **-i → -e** before direct ones (*lo, la, li, le, ne*): **Ti mando il documento** → **Te lo mando**; **Mi presti la penna?** → **Me la presti?**; **Ci portate le chiavi?** → **Ce le portate?**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Special case: third person",
     "texto": [
      "«Gli» (to him) and «le» (to her) take the single shared form **glie-**, which joins with the direct pronoun: **glielo**, **gliela**, **glieli**, **gliele**, **gliene**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Structure",
     "columnas": [
